                                                "sense_id": "a66fde2a-0a66-3e02-93df-95abc0589277",
                                                "text": "\"Although effective in degrading pesticides with P-O bonds, washing of the vegetables sprayed with the thiolester organophosphate insecticide malathion with the enzyme did not yield any improved degradation.\""
